// Solid points on the flap centreline, about every 2.5 mm (included in the
// functions of system/controlDict). solidPointDisplacement reports the
// closest mesh point, so the points are nodes of the tutorial mesh (every
// 1 mm in z); the name gives the undeformed z in tenths of a millimetre.
